{%- comment -%}
  Parameters:
  - type {String} - Payment type: visa, master, american_express, apple_pay,
    google_pay, capitec_pay, snapscan or scan_to_pay.

  Usage:
  {% render 'payment-icon', type: 'visa' %}

  Brave Hardy Change: one-colour payment logos that take the text colour
  (fill="currentColor"), so they suit the footer's dark background. Shopify's
  payment_type_svg_tag icons are full-colour cards of mixed styles and have no
  SnapScan icon. Paths come from Shopify's payment icons and SnapScan's own logo.
{%- endcomment -%}

